ctor":"Communication Services","industry":"Publishing","employees":2148,"city":"Chai Wan","summary":"Media Chinese International Limited, an investment holding company, publishes, prints, and distributes newspapers, magazines, books, and digital content in Hong Kong, Taiwan, and Malaysia. The company is involved in publishing and distributing periodicals; property investment and letting of property activities; digital multimedia business; media operations; and artiste and events management. It also provides editorial and advertising services, travel and travel-related services, printing services, management services, creative and marketing solutions, and educational services and resources. The company was formerly known as Ming Pao Enterprise Corporation Limited and changed its name to Media Chinese International Limited in April 2008. Media Chinese International Limited was incorporated in 1991 and is headquartered in Chai Wan, Hong Kong.","zh":"Media Chinese International Limited 是一家投资控股公司，于1991年成立，总部位于香港柴湾，前身为Ming Pao Enterprise Corporation Limited，于2008年4月更名为现名。公司在香港、台湾和马来西亚从事报纸、杂志、书籍及数字内容的出版、印刷和发行。","lines":["出版与发行：出版和发行报纸、杂志、书籍及期刊，客户为香港、台湾和马来西亚的读者。","数字多媒体业务：运营数字多媒体业务，提供数字内容，客户为线上受众。","媒体运营：进行媒体运营，并提供编辑和广告服务，客户为广告商和读者。","艺人及活动管理：提供艺人管理和活动管理服务，客户为艺人和活动主办方。","旅游服务：提供旅游及旅游相关服务，客户为旅行者。","印刷服务：提供印刷服务，客户为有印刷需求的机构或个人。"],"lines_en":["Publishing and Distribution: Publishes and distributes newspapers, magazines, books, and periodicals to readers in Hong Kong, Taiwan, and Malaysia.","Digital Multimedia Business: Operates digital multimedia business and provides digital content to online audiences.","Media Operations: Conducts media operations and provides editorial and advertising services to advertisers and readers.","Artiste and Events Management: Provides artiste and events management services to artistes and event organizers.","Travel Services: Provides travel and travel-related services to travelers.","Printing Services: Provides printing services to clients with printing needs."]}}